, 1.109, 1.43]}}, "early": {"dir": "down", "tier": "anticipated", "signals": ["MACD histogram rolled over off a peak (pre-cross)", "StochRSI dropped out of overbought"], "n": 2}, "ladder": {"state": "TOP WATCH", "label": "NEARING A HIGH", "action": "TAKE PROFITS", "dir": "up", "score": -32, "why": "A daily bottoming setup did fire (swing low in, momentum turned up), but it's LATE \u2014 price is already extended above the cycle low (formed ~21 day(s) ago @ 58.4) and overbought (daily RSI 72). A momentum cross is a LAGGING confirmation: after a vertical run it only triggers once the move is mature, so the bottoming entry has already passed. This is a chase, not a fresh buy. Last cycle was left-translated (topped early) \u2014 a bearish structural tell.", "next": "Don't initiate here. Wait for a pullback toward the 10-day average \u2014 or the next daily-cycle low to set up \u2014 for a lower-risk entry; hold if you're already long.", "weekly_ok": false, "regime": "neutral", "regime_label": "MIXED", "regime_why": "weekly momentum positive; last cycle left-translated (topped early)", "regime_score": 0.5, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: MIXED \u2014 weekly momentum positive; last cycle left-translated (topped early) (investor cycle week 11 \u00b7 daily cycle day 53).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): nearing a high. Bigger picture (no clear trend): mixed.", "points": ["Bigger picture is mixed (no clear trend for a daily long)", "Macro: US net liquidity neutral \u2014 no macro tilt on the odds", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Back above the 10-day average, and it's turning up", "Prior cycle topped early (a tiring-trend hint)"], "entry": {"tag": "DON'T CHASE", "tag_zh": "\u52ff\u8ffd\u9ad8", "urgency": "caution", "text": "You missed the bottoming entry \u2014 the low already formed and price is now extended and overbought (daily RSI 72). Don't chase; wait for a pullback to the 10-day average or the next cycle low. Hold if already long.", "text_zh": "\u5df2\u9519\u8fc7\u7b51\u5e95\u5165\u573a\u2014\u2014\u4f4e\u70b9\u5df2\u7ecf\u5f62\u6210\uff0c\u76ee\u524d\u4ef7\u683c\u5df2\u62c9\u4f38\u4e14\u8d85\u4e70\uff08\u65e5\u7ebf RSI 72\uff09\u3002\u4e0d\u8981\u8ffd\u9ad8\uff1b\u7b49\u5f85\u56de\u8c03\u81f3 10 \u65e5\u5747\u7ebf\u6216\u4e0b\u4e00\u4e2a\u5468\u671f\u4f4e\u70b9\u3002\u82e5\u5df2\u6301\u6709\u5219\u7ee7\u7eed\u6301\u6709\u3002"}, "cycle_plain": {"daily_line": "Daily cycle: day 53 of a typical 36\u201342 trading days", "daily_phase": "overdue \u2014 past the typical window, so a low could form any day", "daily_line_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 53 \u5929\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 36\u201342 \u4e2a\u4ea4\u6613\u65e5", "daily_phase_zh": "\u903e\u671f\u2014\u2014\u5df2\u8d85\u8fc7\u5178\u578b\u7a97\u53e3\uff0c\u4f4e\u70b9\u968f\u65f6\u53ef\u80fd\u5f62\u6210", "weekly_line": "Weekly (investor) cycle: week 11 of a typical 16\u201326 weeks", "weekly_phase": "mid \u2014 the bigger up-leg is maturing", "weekly_line_zh": "\u5468\u7ebf\uff08\u6295\u8d44\u8005\uff09\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 11 \u5468\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 16\u201326 \u5468", "weekly_phase_zh": "\u4e2d\u671f\u2014\u2014\u66f4\u5927\u7684\u4e0a\u884c\u6bb5\u6b63\u5728\u6210\u719f", "translation": "The last cycle peaked in its FIRST half ('left-translated') \u2014 weak cycles top early, so this hints the bigger trend is tiring.", "translation_zh": "\u4e0a\u4e00\u5468\u671f\u5728\u524d\u534a\u6bb5\u89c1\u9876\uff08\u201c\u5de6\u79fb\u201d\uff09\u2014\u2014\u5f31\u5468\u671f\u89c1\u9876\u504f\u65e9\uff0c\u8fd9\u6697\u793a\u66f4\u5927\u7684\u8d8b\u52bf\u6b63\u5728\u8d70\u5f31\u3002"}, "early_note": "\u26a1 Early topping signs (anticipated): MACD histogram rolled over off a peak (pre-cross); StochRSI dropped out of overbought. These anticipate a high BEFORE confirmation \u2014 a heads-up to protect gains, not a sell trigger yet.", "early_tier": "anticipated", "early_dir": "down", "why_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u7b51\u5e95\u5f62\u